## Core Components

### Activities
Main UI components that interact with users.

### Fragments  
Reusable UI components for activity layouts.

### ViewModels
Manage UI-related data and handle lifecycle.

### Repositories
Abstract data sources (local/remote).

### Models
Data classes representing API responses.

